=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  menu-layout ssh ----------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Adopted 2026-11-14: no Figma frame. Adopted 2026-11-15: one$
# SSH row for SSH Login, SSH Auth and SSH Port. All three$
# configured: auth, login, port. Login and auth configured, the$
# port on 22: Partial, no line. Login and auth not both$
# configured: their state and detail, and the port on 22 a line$
# under the row. The Proxmox VE words, "ports", "2 ports",$
# "port:" and "not 22" are proposed. One row is cut: login and$
# auth off alike.$
$
All three configured:$
  [+] SSH                  + key-only, no root, port 2230$
$
The port left on 22:$
  [ ] SSH                  Partial default port (22)$
$
Root by key, port 22:$
  [ ] SSH                  Partial root key-only$
                             ~ Default port (22)$
$
Passwords on, port 22:$
  [ ] SSH                  Not Configured password auth on$
                             ~ Default port (22)$
$
Passwords on, port 2230:$
  [ ] SSH                  Not Configured password auth on$
$
Root may log in, port 22:$
  [ ] SSH                  Not Configured root allowed$
                             ~ Default port (22)$
$
Login and auth off, one worse:$
  [ ] SSH                  Not Configured password auth on$
                             ~ Default port (22)$
$
Login and auth off alike:$
  [ ] SSH                  Not Configured root allowed, passw...$
                             ~ Default port (22)$
$
A long detail:$
  [ ] SSH                  Partial match block allows passwords$
$
Ports 22 and 2230:$
  [ ] SSH                  Partial ports 22 and 2230$
$
Root by key, ports 22 and 2230:$
  [ ] SSH                  Partial root key-only$
                             ~ Ports 22 and 2230$
$
Two ports, neither 22:$
  [+] SSH                  + key-only, no root, 2 ports$
$
Key and password:$
  [+] SSH                  + key+password, no root, port 2230$
$
The port not read:$
  [?] SSH                  Unknown port: not listening on 2230$
                             ~ Counted as not configured$
$
Passwords on, the port not read:$
  [ ] SSH                  Not Configured password auth on$
                             ~ Counted as not configured$
$
Passwords on, root not read, port 22:$
  [ ] SSH                  Not Configured password auth on$
                             ~ Default port (22)$
                             ~ Counted as not configured$
$
sshd not read:$
  [?] SSH                  Unknown can't read$
                             ~ Counted as not configured$
$
No SSH server:$
  [-] SSH                  Not Applicable no SSH server$
$
Proxmox VE, all three configured:$
  [+] SSH                  + key-only, root key-only, port 22$
$
Proxmox VE as installed:$
  [ ] SSH                  Not Configured root allowed, passw...$
$
Proxmox VE, off port 22:$
  [ ] SSH                  Partial port 2230, not 22$
$
